          "body": "The v2 migration guide (`MIGRATION.md`, \"Router\" section) links rou3 to `https://rou3.h3.dev/`. That host has no DNS record, so the link fails. This points it at the rou3 repository, https://github.com/h3js/rou3.\n\nDocs only.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the rou3 link in the routing migration note to point to the GitHub repository instead of the previous documentation URL. No other documentation content was changed. This update affects only the referenced destination; the routing guidance and other migration information remain unchanged.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
